{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41839","headline":"新秋有感 · 李中","name":"新秋有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门巷凉秋至，高梧一叶惊。\n渐添衾簟爽，顿觉梦魂清。\n暗促莲开艳，乍催蝉发声。\n雨降炎气减，竹引冷烟生。\n戍客添归思，行人怯远程。\n未逢征鴈下，渐听夜砧鸣。\n张翰思鲈兴，班姬咏扇情。\n音尘两难问，蛩砌月空明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}